  <descriptions>
    <description descriptionType="Abstract">This dataset contains the numerical data used in the JECE paper on plastic waste-derived CNTs for CWPO. It includes material characterization data, including yields, metal/ash contents, textural properties, TGA, XRD, and FTIR, as well as catalytic results for PCM degradation, H2O2 consumption, TOC removal, H2O2 efficiency, metal leaching, catalyst washing effects, and CNTs prepared from real plastic waste.</description>
